# The Skullspore Nexus: the token's size is "the total power of those creatures", and a creature with 0 power adds nothing (a negative power takes
# from it, CR 107.1b). Bot1 controls only Arboreal Grazer (0/3), so the Nexus costs the full {6}{G}{G} on turn 3: four Moxen, Black Lotus (three
# green) and a Forest pay exactly eight. Bot2's Wrath of God on turn 6 destroys the Grazer, the Nexus triggers and makes a 0/0 Fungus Dinosaur that
# state-based actions put into the graveyard at once (CR 704.5f), so Bot1 is left with the Forest, four Moxen and the Nexus and nothing else.

